        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PHOTOSENSITIVITY WARNING: THIS GAME CONTAINS STROBING LIGHTS AND HARSH FLASHES. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DISTURBING CONTENT: THIS GAME FEATURES DISTURBING CONTENT AND IS NOT SUITABLE FOR CHILDREN.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The old, unfinished Lily's Lil Games webseries is back, and recompiled for modern systems! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the Happy Video Store, where every day is a brand-new adventure! Step into the shoes of Lily, a bright and cheerful employee determined to become the <i>very best worker</i> her little hometown rental shop has ever seen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your job sounds simple enough:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📼 Sort through endless VHS tapes and keep the rows looking perfect.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🛒 Stock shelves and clean up after customers, no matter how messy they get.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >👭 Spend time with Mimi, Lily’s best friend who sometimes stops by during shifts.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every shift gives you new challenges, new visitors, and new chances to help Lily prove she’s the best employee.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clock in. Do your best. Keep the shelves tidy.<br>At the Happy Video Store, the fun never ends.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PHOTOSENSITIVITY WARNING: THIS GAME CONTAINS STROBING LIGHTS AND HARSH FLASHES. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DISTURBING CONTENT: THIS GAME FEATURES DISTURBING CONTENT AND IS NOT SUITABLE FOR CHILDREN.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The old, unfinished Lily's Lil Games webseries is back, and recompiled for modern systems! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the Happy Video Store, where every day is a brand-new adventure! Step into the shoes of Lily, a bright and cheerful employee determined to become the <i>very best worker</i> her little hometown rental shop has ever seen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your job sounds simple enough:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📼 Sort through endless VHS tapes and keep the rows looking perfect.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🛒 Stock shelves and clean up after customers, no matter how messy they get.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >👭 Spend time with Mimi, Lily’s best friend who sometimes stops by during shifts.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every shift gives you new challenges, new visitors, and new chances to help Lily prove she’s the best employee.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clock in. Do your best. Keep the shelves tidy.<br>At the Happy Video Store, the fun never ends.</p>",
